<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! face.intent.issues ~ issue ~ a votum names a verb and its audience

`lares intent issue <verb>` signs one intent (a votum) naming the verb, its JSON `--args` and its audience: `--to` pins one atom, `--prefer` names a preference, `--class` a class, `--every` every holder. `--void-at` and `--through` bound it. An idempotent verb names its votum by its word alone (the empty nonce), so the same word twice reads one votum; any other takes a fresh `--nonce` unless the line names one. A `face-join` asks the face's founding hearth to seat this vessel and carries its own ContactCard. The answer prints the intent id.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ issue

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`issue` params=`verb/face-join ~ ask the founding hearth to seat this vessel`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ verb · args · to · prefer · class · every · void-at · through · nonce · face

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`verb` params=`takes/verb needs/required seat/1 as/<verb> ~ the verb the intent names`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`args` params=`takes/json ~ the verb's args as JSON`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`to` params=`takes/atom ~ pin the audience to one atom`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`prefer` params=`takes/atom ~ name a preferred executor`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`class` params=`takes/class ~ address a class of executors`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`every` params=`kind/switch ~ address every holder`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`void-at` params=`takes/cite ~ the intent voids at this point`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`through` params=`takes/cite ~ the intent stands through this point`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`nonce` params=`takes/hex ~ the nonce; an idempotent verb takes the empty one`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`face` params=`takes/index ~ the face whose intent plane this reads or writes, a whole persona index from 0`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ seat

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`seat` params=`who/seat-or-hand key/face-atom ~ signs under the face's own atom key through the store door`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · face-malformed · face-not-held · args-malformed · verb-absent · intent-id-taken · hearth-absent

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`~ an unknown sub-verb, or no sub-verb named`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`face-malformed` params=`~ --face names a whole persona index from 0`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`face-not-held` params=`~ this vessel holds no such face`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`args-malformed` params=`~ --args reads as no JSON`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`verb-absent` params=`~ name the verb`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`intent-id-taken` params=`~ the same word stands under another audience or bound`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`hearth-absent` params=`~ the face's log names no founding hearth; name one with --to`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ issued · refused

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`issued` params=`exit/0 fields/[[id cid]] ~ the intent id prints`>>
<<has entity=`band` name=`refused` params=`exit/1 ~ [lares intent] refused: names the code`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

